    .. versionchanged:: 2.2
        Option names are always converted to lowercase.
    .. versionchanged:: 2.1
        The ``multiple`` parameter is deprecated and will be removed in
        Werkzeug 2.2.
    .. versionchanged:: 0.15
        :rfc:`2231` parameter continuations are handled.
    .. versionadded:: 0.5
